<title>USA: Southwest Bancorp stake raised by company.</title>
<headline>Southwest Bancorp stake raised by company.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Fidelity Assurance Co said Wednesday it raised its stake in Southwest Bancorp Inc to 7.54 percent, or 283,918 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, American Fidelity said it bought 37,618 additional shares of Southwest on October 29 for $19.375 each.</p>
</text>
